message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "FVS-ACD v12.11 benchmark: six Acadian growth and yield model generations against OSM-ACD v2.26.1, with a measured-height coverage census"
version: "12.11.0"
date-released: "2026-08-04"
license: CC-BY-4.0
# doi and url are added after the concept DOI mints; see RUNBOOK.md 'After it mints'.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Weiskittel
    given-names: Aaron
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2534-4478"
    affiliation: "Center for Research on Sustainable Forests, University of Maine"
  - family-names: Rice
    given-names: Ben
    affiliation: "Midgard Natural Resources"
abstract: >-
  An independent benchmark of FVS-ACD, the Acadian variant of the Forest
  Vegetation Simulator, covering six model generations against OSM-ACD v2.26.1
  on the FIA National Scale Volume and Biomass system. Includes the benchmark
  report, the variant overview GTR, every scorecard behind the reported
  numbers, and a measured-height coverage census across all eleven staged
  benchmark sources. Aggregates only; no FIA true plot coordinates.
keywords:
  - forestry
  - growth and yield
  - Forest Vegetation Simulator
  - Acadian
  - FIA
  - NSVB
